  "prefLabel": "Plc 1404.03 Additional Information Required for Initial License Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1404.03 Additional Information Required for Initial License Application. In addition to the information required by Plc 304.03, the applicant for an initial license to practice recreational therapy shall provide information about the applicant’s field experience, as follows:\n\n(a) The name of each employer at which the applicant worked or volunteered;\n\n(b) The name and credentials of each CTRS who supervised the applicant’s field experience; and\n\n(c) Confirmation that the applicant met the NCTRC requirements for field experience that were in effect at the time the applicant completed the field experience.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1400) #13705, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14442, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES 1-26-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1400.html"
